    "body": "Lessons from the Paged Experts explainer video (sgl-project/sglang PR 42557 and its five follow-ups).\n\n- **pronunciation.md, line_asr table:** 「K 是 63」 is heard as K163 because 是 after a letter fuses into the number, so write 「K 等于 63」. A lone lowercase code variable (专家 e) is read as 一, so name the thing instead. 散回 is heard as 算回. The narration rule paragraph now says both.\n- **pronunciation.md, seg_check table:** four new cuts with the rewordings that passed: 内存放不下 → 内|存放, 上下文限到 → 上下|文限, 单独列出来 → 单|独列, 拿来放 → 拿|来放.\n- **house-style.md:** when the user asks for it, an SGLang video may use a designed, project-local cover instead of cover A. The hook words are the largest line, it uses one accent and a line-art illustration of the mechanism, and it keeps a small 「SGLang PR 讲解 · #N」 tag so the 小红书 标记 still fits.\n\nDocs only; pre-commit passes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
